# Bind source for the default profile's /workspace mount.
#
# Committed rather than left to Docker: a missing bind source is auto-created by
# the daemon as root-owned, and the agent containers run as uid 1000 and cannot
# write to it -- which would turn a security fix into a broken demo profile.
#
# The contents are git-ignored (see ../.gitignore). This directory exists so the
# demo profile has a working /workspace that is NOT this checkout: 01.3 puts a
# control plane (policy/, mediator/config/, mediator/identity/) into the solution
# tree, and binding that tree read-write into the agents would let a compromised
# agent rewrite the input to the next `docker compose build`.
